#: bp-user-todo-list.php
msgid "Todo for BuddyPress & BuddyBoss"
msgstr "Todo for BuddyPress & BuddyBoss"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: bp-user-todo-list.php
msgid "https://wbcomdesigns.com/downloads/buddypress-user-to-do-list/"
msgstr "https://wbcomdesigns.com/downloads/buddypress-user-to-do-list/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: bp-user-todo-list.php
msgid ""
"Personal and team todo lists for WordPress. Works standalone, and adds a "
"member profile tab plus group todos when BuddyPress or BuddyBoss is active."
msgstr ""
"Elenchi di cose da fare personali e di team per WordPress. Funziona in modo "
"autonomo e aggiunge una scheda del profilo del membro e To-do di gruppo "
"quando BuddyPress o BuddyBoss è attivo."

#. Author of the plugin
#: bp-user-todo-list.php
msgid "Wbcom Designs"
msgstr "Wbcom Designs"

#. Author URI of the plugin
